                        <item>
                         <widget class="QTextBrowser" name="train_info_textBrowser">
                          <property name="sizePolicy">
                           <sizepolicy hsizetype="Expanding" vsizetype="Expanding">
                            <horstretch>0</horstretch>
                            <verstretch>0</verstretch>
                           </sizepolicy>
                          </property>
                          <property name="styleSheet">
                           <string notr="true">QTextBrowser#train_info_textBrowser {
	border: 1px solid rgb(70,80,100)
}</string>
                          </property>
                          <property name="html">
                           <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'微软雅黑'; font-size:9pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Training Parameters&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#ffcf0f;&quot;&gt;Images path&lt;/span&gt;: Click &amp;quot;Open&amp;quot; to select the path of the image folder in 3D TIF format.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#ffcf0f;&quot;&gt;SWC path&lt;/span&gt;: Click &amp;quot;Open&amp;quot; to select the path of the swc point cloud folder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#ffcf0f;&quot;&gt;Save path&lt;/span&gt;: Click &amp;quot;Open&amp;quot; to select the path of the save folder. After starting the training, click &amp;quot;Look&amp;quot; to view the path. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#ffcf0f;&quot;&gt;Images Type&lt;/span&gt;: Select the type of image to process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#ffcf0f;&quot;&gt;Train Epochs&lt;/span&gt;: The optimal choice for training rounds is generally between 250 and 1000 rounds. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#ffcf0f;&quot;&gt;Continue Training&lt;/span&gt;: Select the &amp;quot;checkpoint_final.pth&amp;quot; model path to continue training. There is no need to set &amp;quot;Images Type&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;Train Epochs&amp;quot; for continuing training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;The selected model path &amp;quot;checkpoint_final.pth&amp;quot; must be located in the &amp;quot;Save path&amp;quot; folder, typically in the path &amp;quot;Save path/nnUNetFrame/nnUNet_results/.../fold_X/checkpoint_final.pth&amp;quot;. Otherwise, the training will be restarted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Click &amp;quot;Start Training&amp;quot; to begin training the model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Click &amp;quot;End Training&amp;quot; to end the training of the model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Click &amp;quot;Training Visualization&amp;quot; to view the training loss curve.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
                          </property>
                         </widget>
                        </item>
                       </layout>
                      </item>
                     </layout>
                    </widget>
